    "profile_text": {
        "body": "EHang Holdings Ltd, also known as EHANG HOLDINGS LTD-SPS ADR, is a public company headquartered in Guangzhou and trading on NASDAQ under ticker EH. Its SEC CIK number is 0001759783. The company describes itself as a world's leading autonomous aerial vehicle, or AAV, technology platform company, with a mission to make safe, autonomous and eco-friendly air mobility accessible to everyone.\n\nAccording to its website, EHang provides AAV products and commercial solutions across urban air mobility, including passenger transportation and logistics, smart city management, and aerial media solutions. It lists product areas covering passenger transportation, logistics, emergency rescue, aerial media, and infrastructure solutions. The company presents itself as a forerunner of AAV technologies and commercial solutions in the global Urban Air Mobility industry.",
